WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.363 --> 00:00:03.742
BluePeak HR starts with a secure login page and demo role options.

2
00:00:03.742 --> 00:00:06.149
Admin login is used to show the complete employee management workflow.

3
00:00:06.149 --> 00:00:11.978
The dashboard gives a quick overview of employees, departments, status, and activity.

4
00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:14.349
The Employees page supports search, filters, pagination, and record actions.

5
00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:18.231
Search helps users find employee records by name, email, department, or job title.

6
00:00:18.231 --> 00:00:22.117
The Add Employee page keeps employee creation separate from the list view.

7
00:00:22.117 --> 00:00:27.460
CSV import allows multiple employees to be added with validation.

8
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:32.329
The Departments page summarizes employee counts department wise.

9
00:00:32.329 --> 00:00:37.639
The Users page lets admin manage roles and department access.

10
00:00:37.639 --> 00:00:41.526
The Activity page records important employee and account changes.

11
00:00:41.526 --> 00:00:43.850
The Profile page lets the logged-in user update account details.

12
00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.850
This completes the admin tour of the deployed MERN Employee Management System.
